  "notes": [
    "CodeRim native-smoke fixture, WPF chart/controls and notch source files were identical across these revisions.",
    "Compare installer type to itself. MSI against MSIX within each revision is a repeatability control on separate launches. A repeated difference does not establish causation.",
    "All files contain sRGB RGBA or RGB at PNG pHYs 3779x3779 pixels/metre (about 96dpi). Both hosts use .NET 10.0.15; Windows x64 build 26100 and ARM64 build 26200 match their own controls.",
    "Whole visible-desktop captures historically used CopyFromScreen plus geometry. ARM64 account history and several settings-frame captures show Windows setup privacy on both versions. ARM64 desktop captures are excluded from application-screen proof. WPF RenderTargetBitmap images remain independent of occlusion.",
    "One selected x64 MSI physical screenshot for account history was inspected directly from both revisions; each visibly shows the CodeRim Usage dashboard with 179,456 tokens in the synthetic profile. Others have no historical pixel-ownership attestation.",
    "Residual x64 WPF reset-credits-available (42 pixels in x945..951 y250..257) and ARM64 WPF platform-controls-light (3689 pixels in y416..450) are reproducible between revisions in the two installations; neither establishes a product regression versus an external runner/content/animation difference. Native comparison for these two states remains open."
